// Article 1. Regular schedule: whose week it is, and where Mia is.
Fact parent Identified by Rosa, Daniel
Placeholder other For parent
Param start : Time = 0
Var with Identified by parent

Bool rosa-week
  Holds when (Current Time - start) - ((Current Time - start) / 14) * 14 < 7
Bool handover-day
  Holds when (Current Time - start) - ((Current Time - start) / 7) * 7 < 1
Duty regular-week Holder parent Claimant other
  Holds when rosa-week() && parent == Daniel && other == Rosa
           , Not(rosa-week()) && parent == Rosa && other == Daniel
  Violated when with(parent) && Not(handover-day())
Act hand-over Actor parent Recipient other
  Holds when with(parent)
  Creates with(other)

Clause 1.1 Approved "4473c5ddafcbf661079ff8a35c14ff25403a6b6af2617f33ae26276355c0c2b4"
  Norm "Mia lives with her parents, Rosa Castellan and Daniel Castellan, in alternating weeks. The first week is Rosa's." => regular-week
Clause 1.2 Approved "0dc27972c97137cb9e66f0c0b0b9641111bfd49216aaa1cd34bdd1c118daed76"
  Norm "On the first day of a parent's week the other parent hands Mia over." => regular-week, hand-over
.
+with(Rosa).
